// `Predicate.HasTypeIgnoringTypeChanges` under Lean's own name for it: the
// alias `declare_semantic_primitives` generates, so a card writes a macro where
// the basis has a constructor (ADR 12.1). "<type>, ignoring any type-changing
// effects that would affect it" [CR#702.44a,613.1d].
(
    name: "hasTypeIgnoringTypeChanges",
    kinds: [Predicate],
    params: {"type": Any},
    body: HasTypeIgnoringTypeChanges(Param(type)),
)
